# AMReX's Poisson solvers. The multigrid solver is always built.
# When Flash-X is built with AmrexFFT=True, AMReX's FFT Poisson solver is built. 
# gr_amrexPoisson_useFFT can select at it runtime.
REQUIRES Grid/GridSolvers/Amrex/MultigridSolver

USESETUPVARS AmrexFFT
IF AmrexFFT
   REQUIRES Grid/GridSolvers/Amrex/FFTSolver
ENDIF
